---
import Project from '../Project.astro'
import SectionTitle from '../SectionTitle.astro'
---

<section class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:gap-4">
  <SectionTitle title="Selected Client Work" />
  <p
    class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 -mt-1 sm:-mt-2"
  >
    Closed-source engagements: the code is private, but I'm happy to walk
    through the architecture of any of these in detail.
  </p>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
    <Project
      title="SuperPower / SuperClaw"
      status="Case Study"
      description={`A crypto-native platform selling autonomous AI agents for USDT on BNB Chain, where each purchase auto-provisioned a dedicated, cert-pinned VM running the agent in about two minutes. Built and operated solo, end-to-end, in 15 weeks. The product has since been sunset; the engineering stands.\nInteger-credit LLM metering ledger with per-key provider spend caps as the enforcement boundary and cron-driven drift reconciliation; crash-safe two-phase on-chain USDT orders with gas-sponsored server-side signing and idempotent chain reconciliation; and an isolation proxy as the sole ingress to the VM fleet: per-VM TLS pinning, RPC allowlisting, and fleet-wide model overrides without redeploys.`}
      stack={[
        'OpenRouter',
        'viem / BNB Chain',
        'Privy',
        'Hono + oRPC',
        'Postgres / Drizzle',
        'DigitalOcean',
        'AWS KMS',
      ]}
    />
    <Project
      title="Prolly.so"
      status="Case Study"
      description={`An AI-powered, on-chain prediction-market platform, built as sole engineer through three client rebrands over ~13 months.\nA multi-LLM consensus oracle (Claude + Gemini + Grok over multi-source evidence) autonomously resolves markets on-chain; two-phase USDT checkout with advisory-lock inventory reservation and mempool-aware reconciliation crons; AMM contracts iterated through four fuzz-tested Solidity versions with Solana (Rust) and Move ports; plus a scheduled job fleet, Telegram/Discord/Twitter bots, and a key-authenticated agent API with an MCP server.`}
      stack={[
        'Vercel AI SDK',
        'Solidity / Foundry',
        'Rust / Solana',
        'tRPC',
        'TimescaleDB',
        'Trigger.dev',
      ]}
    />
    <Project
      title="SpotRoyale"
      imageUrl="/projects/spotroyale.png"
      status="Client work"
      description={`A fractional music-royalty marketplace: sellers list a share of a song's royalties, investors buy via Stripe (card + stablecoin), and ownership is minted as an ERC-721 certificate on Polygon mainnet.\nIdempotent Stripe checkout and signed webhooks drive a 7-state settlement pipeline (payment → mint → on-chain confirmation) on a job queue, with failed/refunded purchases excluded from ownership accounting, on-chain metadata with dynamically generated SVG certificates, and a streaming-data valuation pipeline aggregating billions of plays.`}
      stack={[
        'Stripe',
        'Solidity / Polygon',
        'Next.js',
        'Hono + oRPC',
        'Postgres / Drizzle',
        'pg-boss',
      ]}
      websiteUrl="https://sr-app-9f4e.vercel.app"
      websiteLabel="Live Site"
    />
  </div>
</section>
